  sequence:
  - invoker: {fileID: 1538461450}
    text: I can see your power and how determined you are. You actually vanished
      all of them. And here's the shield -Egidas Shield. It contains inside it first
      half of the Afines soul, it was created to win against True Gorgon. Afines
      soul with its power grants its holder Egidas power,  and the shield itself
      can deflect any gods attack. Indestructable. The ship will allow you to leave
      this place, and find what you're searching for. We'll meet again.
    autoContinue: 0
    autoContinueDelay: 0
  SkipTrigger: 0
